Aku takkan lama.

00:20:40.298 --> 00:20:42.588
Serius, aku bisa mendapat
masalah besar.

00:20:42.633 --> 00:20:43.839
Siapa yang akan tahu?

00:20:43.876 --> 00:20:46.730
Izinkan saja dia gunakan toilet!

00:20:46.755 --> 00:20:49.928
Dia akan memberimu
imbalan setimpal!

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:51.490
Temanmu?

00:20:51.515 --> 00:20:54.808
Ya, maaf, dia mabuk.

00:20:54.833 --> 00:20:56.848
