00:21:52.532 --> 00:21:53.963
Aku tak apa.

00:21:53.988 --> 00:21:56.286
Kau ingat jalan kita masuk?

00:21:56.311 --> 00:21:57.912
Aku ingat.

00:21:58.776 --> 00:22:02.521
Oke. Semoga malammu indah.

00:22:02.546 --> 00:22:05.587
Kau juga. Terima kasih sekali lagi.

00:22:05.821 --> 00:22:07.406
Tidak masalah.

00:22:42.749 --> 00:22:45.227
<i>Toko Super Halloween Craven's.</i>

00:22:45.252 --> 00:22:47.129
